{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7d0a01a7e3e26ead6812d94c0609e47786e32d838c2dc8200bf0172998790064", "ja": "Film …　始まりのサイン", "zh": "Film …　开始的信号", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b128701f21f03b9debff275f58782461dcfe3c6ae08e4161ad9cb3cb365bb409", "ja": "こけら落としライブは大成功。新オーナーに\n頼まれ、楽屋の真っ白な壁にサインをする\nメンバー。オーナーの想いに触れ、ここに\nあの『≡君彩≡』が立っていたんだと言って\nもらえるようなバンドになる、と宣言する。", "zh": "开幕演唱会大获成功。受新老板所托，成员们在后台纯白的墙上签名。感受到老板的心意后，她们宣布要成为一支能让人说出“那支『≡君彩≡』曾站在这里”的乐队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1f36e3479c02aa54ec81ef02aae4a517a24de1e72caad6d3efc9762a594e8cf2", "ja": "（ハードなスケジュールを乗り切って、\n『≡君彩≡』は最高のステージを見せてくれた！）", "zh": "（『≡君彩≡』克服了紧张的日程安排，为大家带来了最棒的舞台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2a6c05fe26105627a08d78c284dc1d2197f7a90a537c20887ca8d825f85661e9", "ja": "お疲れさま！　いいライブだったよ！\n……って、みんなヘトヘトだな。大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了！刚才的演出很精彩！\n……不过，大家都累得筋疲力尽了。没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "178720be1c6925a21647d0af27bc3466244d69ba5ab04aad63411756c4b4c165", "ja": "す、すみません～……。\n気が抜けたらこうなっちゃって。", "zh": "对、对不起～……  \n一放松下来就变成这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "cf3f0395f932687d327cf4ab350460f381a3ffeb56da2e157d9caecf5ee6f50f", "ja": "ありさも、今日は出し切りました……！\nもう何も出ません……。", "zh": "亚利沙今天也已经彻底燃尽了……！\n已经一点都挤不出来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "80565de1d3fc571234d351758d02d00196e3e2d481285f808da8611e827bd103", "ja": "ははは。\nそんなみんなに、元気が出る知らせがあるぞ！", "zh": "哈哈哈。\n有个能让大家打起精神来的消息哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca9cea4b5fe304ad906a206b1bef9ef1073adde75a9e8413bfb74e3e5dc20b56", "ja": "元気が出る知らせ？　なになに？", "zh": "能让人打起精神的消息？什么什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b80f702cea100d5c0067a768abacf6bc9ee505b352a2a59cf4b5997189d28b08", "ja": "実は今日、あの『Queen gazelle』の\nメンバーが、お忍びで観に来てたんだ。", "zh": "其实今天，那个“Queen gazelle”的\n成员，有低调微服来看表演哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "edcc913416fb3398e0ee035f70e86586b3a70c6fad7532e9a8c466aea77c1a24", "ja": "ええ！？　『Queen gazelle』って、\nあの超人気ロックバンドの……！？", "zh": "诶诶！？『Queen gazelle』，就是那支超有人气的摇滚乐队……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3280fa75f02dd42e684b2234aabf2ff7f0d16c2df5a5ce72af51a72f5279dc3e", "ja": "ああ。それで、さっきわざわざ楽屋に来てくれて……\n『≡君彩≡』が今日は一番良かったって、褒めてたよ。", "zh": "嗯。然后，他还特意来后台……\n夸我们说，今天表现最好的是『≡君彩≡』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "d04e8f5cb1a9a16c885fd02d8fe667a192c769e8d077c0ff9fb07b29f3456880", "ja": "そ、そんな、有名なバンドの人が、\n私たちを褒めてくれたんですか……！？", "zh": "那、那个，有名乐队的人居然夸奖了我们……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "963bb5871004b9c3ad1946671c85c7c4e72baafd06b04c02a2581ffaba164b06", "ja": "うん。あと、みんなの演奏を聴いて、\nバンドを始めた頃の気持ちを思い出したって。", "zh": "嗯。而且他还说，听了大家的演奏，\n让他回想起了刚开始组乐队时的那种心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "00369838edd5193e8c6bc7daf21bf7b2b53faa5a23ae975efae5aab89a87c281", "ja": "えっと。それって、すっごい褒め言葉だよね！？", "zh": "那个……这应该是非常高的评价吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "687ad0cafaa02f660ccf9d1f7e0e3a84b8ae403e53a1790256b29a396b8e951a", "ja": "もちろん。みんなの演奏に\n刺激を受けたって事じゃないかな。", "zh": "当然。应该是受到了大家演奏的刺激吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "d3bca2527fe6780ea6d3ea682c28e03d6ad9076c34eaf72222ffae50706406b2", "ja": "ふわぁ～……。ありさたち、初ライブの時は\n「アイドルがバンドなんて」って言われてたのに……。", "zh": "呼啊～……我们第一次演出的时候，\n明明还被人说过“偶像怎么能组乐队”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "0570742904c267dbe1814aa96a4d156930b48153270cc8bad5f0ef34c7c06a91", "ja": "そんなこともあったね～。あ、でも今日の出演者に\nアイドルのバンドが、もう一組いたよね？", "zh": "确实有过那种事呢～啊，不过今天的出演者里，不是还有另一支偶像乐队吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "6b3ff38a7073d101deb3862ad3bab8ed1f74266b0651939782455a137164433d", "ja": "そうなんです！　ありさ、一度イベントで\n観たことがあったんですケド……。", "zh": "没错！亚利沙以前在活动上看过一次，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "466097200cb2f917d4c35a136b33e2fc236a00bb6bced40438565c854c3ff1fd", "ja": "演奏技術の進化が、大変、素晴らしくて！\nアイドルバンド、侮れませんよ～～～っ！！", "zh": "演奏技术的进步实在太棒了！\n偶像乐队真是不可小觑啊～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "6bceef8c618a4790a39cebc4381834760416866194b918cb743aeb0fe7ae9efd", "ja": "たしかに……私たちが始めたころよりも、\nバンドに挑戦するアイドルって結構増えてますよね？", "zh": "确实……和我们刚开始的时候相比，  \n挑战乐队演奏的偶像增加了不少呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "27152e34b0a21797be31bf95997ea1e71cc69788a4bce3c7317bfbe42245cf67", "ja": "そうだな。もしかするとみんなの演奏も、\nアイドルバンドの道を切り拓いたひとつかもな。", "zh": "是啊。说不定，大家的演奏也为偶像乐队开辟了道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1019_sinona", "source_sha256": "733112eedc36a889c1b6b2b66fc446b41d7d0dcb8d470c3ecaf4da3612c9666f", "ja": "もしかしなくても、可能性はあると思いますよ。", "zh": "毫无疑问，我觉得还是有可能的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "8a579b9fdec8133c0211247e8a2ac2499a7d6d110d320246ae12f9acf60bf635", "ja": "あ、オーナーさん！　お疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "啊，老板！辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1022_sinona", "source_sha256": "7148f54f5557a8b9d5d61c96a2f4bc254c13a21f7903276752da2e74a1ff1f53", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れ様です。今日は\nありがとうございました、期待以上でした。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。今天\n非常感谢，表现超出预期。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "fe7ae8ad3d9432ca7cd7a704b9d212108c62dab893b5ffcdf2bb8506ee5407b0", "ja": "そんな、期待以上だなんて……えへっ♪\nこちらこそ、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "哪里哪里，您说超过期待什么的……嘿嘿♪\n我才要谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1024_sinona", "source_sha256": "0921ed2e926f2a1fef959fa988d4b316209c2df06fddb239c20ae1905782bee7", "ja": "『庭園』のライブで聞いた時から、思ってたんです。\nこのバンドは、いいバンドになるって。", "zh": "从在『庭园』的演出中听到时，我就一直这么想。\n这个乐队一定会成为一支优秀的乐队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1025_sinona", "source_sha256": "6c1b5fccc669bd200473f203c5e44a9ce2850aef586ee45e2e68e65fd3461734", "ja": "いずれ、『≡君彩≡』の演奏に憧れて\nバンドを始めるアイドルが、生まれると思いますよ。", "zh": "将来，肯定会诞生因为向往“≡君彩≡”的演奏\n而开始组乐队的偶像哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "dca378a7ef125abfe93ce01f027c445dc4d26bce872c170671a44f21dcc54541", "ja": "あ、ありさたちが、アイドルちゃんが\nバンドを始める理由に……！？", "zh": "啊，亚利沙她们竟然会成为偶像们开始组乐队的理由……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "041775a4c4da7c0473d003fda853a16b504a02c0dafb796e2b8e0641c48fe5a8", "ja": "想像しただけで、光栄ですっ！", "zh": "光是想想就觉得很荣幸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1028_sinona", "source_sha256": "1b66801f6252f5c38dbc2b53c0f1bc39d6ae9af238c339ee19cc9f23a808a8cf", "ja": "そこで、お願いがあるんですが。\nこの楽屋の壁に、サインを書いてもらえませんか？", "zh": "所以，有件事想拜托您。\n可以请您在这间后台休息室的墙上签名吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "b571a3285e5b84c57d53e81bc2cbe2930dfc7c2db15f1bd9fb99d186c3f54e1a", "ja": "サインって、『庭園』で書いた時みたいに、ですか？", "zh": "签名是指像在『庭园』签名时那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1030_sinona", "source_sha256": "91f98e57f8ff502bb1e286497e255b2eb04bfa9f9a1d587cf1ddc875ee5d063c", "ja": "はい。『庭園』の壁にはたくさんのバンドの\nサインがありましたから。", "zh": "是的。因为“庭园”的墙上有很多乐队的签名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1031_sinona", "source_sha256": "b43d6f8827f05b8a6d957e2afe1f58c279868cf645d1be5b8b2d9ceeaf62e5a8", "ja": "あんなふうに、このライブハウスも……たくさんの\nバンドと、歴史を刻んでいければと思いまして。", "zh": "我希望这家Livehouse也能像那样……\n与众多乐队一同铭刻历史。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "6a93715757f340f788b9090f0a636e73eab0c8436856ddcc8c37af47fd501b48", "ja": "で、でもここの壁、まだ真っ白ですケド……\nありさたちが最初でいいんですか？", "zh": "但、但是这里的墙还一片雪白……让我们成为第一个，真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1033_sinona", "source_sha256": "8b79df1690446fd9c1fdad74aa29403e3908abeaaf3f7aee34fdbef342e18f97", "ja": "もちろん、他のバンドのみんなにも\n書いてもらうつもりですが……。", "zh": "当然也打算请其他乐队的大家写，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1034_sinona", "source_sha256": "e4f19e5af12a7dad9dd976cc24860caffa9ac7d6112ccf9d0e409360fdb2c5d6", "ja": "最初は、みなさんのようなフレッシュなバンドが\n相応しいと思って。運もつきそうですし！", "zh": "一开始，我觉得像你们这样充满朝气的乐队最合适。而且看起来运气也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1c6d53e34b73c5204b4c3243685c16eb555b9643a03057fe29b4cf89f489583", "ja": "そういうコトなら、書くっきゃないっしょ！\n{$P$}、いいよね？", "zh": "既然这样，就只能写了吧！\n{$P$}，可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "53976d8a90b688cad91b2baacff17f77f8769b5ff1c99cd55a936b0f3819a569", "ja": "もちろん。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "当然可以。\n我们这边才要请您多关照呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1037_sinona", "source_sha256": "563a8566796c7e96e9fbf3d2197709cbd33e7b9f81da83e66dc9d7fbe8ebc942", "ja": "ありがとう！\nこのライブハウスは、まだ始まったばかりだけど……。", "zh": "谢谢！\n虽然这家Live House才刚刚起步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1038_sinona", "source_sha256": "8bb6f4e1d2957a662ca2dbb87975f714c8ee11e9162ff8a1b40c3fd3709920d3", "ja": "ここに最初にサインをしたことを、みなさんが\n誇りに思えるような場所にしていきますから。", "zh": "我会把这里打造成为一个能让大家为自己最初在此签名而感到自豪的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "bed3e63b346c674fccc17701f9d65621bdf495d71f4df4d561bdde376198a32c", "ja": "わ、私たちも……！\n私たちも、がんばります！", "zh": "我、我们也是……！\n我们也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "38172171e75aa62727d7e6e89f26cebf228e898d8d4503bfe30d95aad9ef0a90", "ja": "ここに、あの『≡君彩≡』が立ってたんだって！\nそう言われるようなバンドに、な、なってみせます！", "zh": "听说，那个『≡君彩≡』曾经站在这里哦！\n我、我们一定会成为让人们这么说的乐队！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "c48b97e2516bda43bf0f3da424e24d56b8b3b3b2795853a17af63d4fbcb143c9", "ja": "言うじゃん、可奈！\nんじゃ、早速サインしちゃおっかな～！", "zh": "可奈说得挺豪气的嘛！\n那，要不现在就顺势签个名吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5a4b916dafeb6292e7c42185d9f0b3b5a40ff3479e84b3430b9076c100718e6", "ja": "あ、ありさ、サイン用のペン持ってますよ！\n太ペンも細ペンも、多色で常備してますっ♪", "zh": "啊，亚利沙带着签名用的笔哦！\n粗笔、细笔，还有多色笔，我都随身备着呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "732d97fb83d94f66117d42ad748970a9cdd3524acc1839ef214daf27e4287ffb", "ja": "真っ白な壁に書くって緊張しますね……！\nなんだか手が震えてきちゃいました。", "zh": "在纯白的墙上签名，真让人紧张啊……！\n不知不觉手都开始发抖了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "79cc5bfc01a1ef66a9b36075f84dfc7dfb50650c5ee297751be21de770295565", "ja": "こういうのは勢いだよ、勢い！\nえっと、誰から書く？　やっぱ亜利沙？", "zh": "这种事就得一鼓作气，一鼓作气！\n那个，要从谁开始写？果然还是亚利沙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "1d704931d8759751b8df2242885fd2e5643bf6df0d29818284e838bd5b377824", "ja": "あ、ありさですかぁ！？", "zh": "啊，是亚利沙吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "cf75a2f72ccd332eaa1f3c3484e574caf9431a6b65727e24c326c27e060301e1", "ja": "（忙しい3人が『≡君彩≡』として集まるのは、\nなかなか難しいけど……）", "zh": "（让忙碌的3个人以『≡君彩≡』的名义聚在一起，确实挺困难的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "beafd10e83d9f03d5b2c2a21d5458772814a6980ce70da90c5fffee5d34d36ac", "ja": "（できる限り、続けたいな。こうして、\n『≡君彩≡』を思い出してくれる人達がいる限り……）", "zh": "（只要还有人记得『≡君彩≡』……我想就尽可能继续下去。像这样，）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
